  "title": "MATKP Submit Your Data",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>Want to contribute your data to a cutting-edge community resource for adipose tissue? We invite you to submit your data to our <a href=\"https://uploads.matkp.org\" target=\"blank\">MATKP Data Registry</a>! We are currently accepting bulk, single cell, and single nucleus RNA-sequencing (RNA-seq) data. If you have any questions or are interested in submitting additional data types, please contact us at <a href=\"help@matkp.org\"><u>help@matkp.org</u></a>.</p>",
